        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Daniel Ricciardo, Valtteri Bottas\n- Organizations: Red Bull Racing, Williams\n- Events: 2014 Belgian Grand Prix, 2014 British Grand Prix\n- Roles: Formula One racing driver\n- Places: Australia\n\nFacts:\n- Daniel Ricciardo was born on 1 July 1989.\n- Daniel Ricciardo is an Australian racing driver who competes in Formula One for Red Bull Racing.\n- In the 2014 British Grand Prix, Valtteri Bottas finished second for Williams, and Daniel Ricciardo finished third for Red Bull Racing.\n- In the 2014 Belgian Grand Prix, Daniel Ricciardo won the 44-lap race for Red Bull Racing after starting from fifth position.",
